    {
      "page": 5,
      "kind": "evidence",
      "case": "hermes",
      "pageId": "summer",
      "title": "Summer: props connect the merchandise",
      "body": "Fishing rods, hands and folding chairs create a viewing path. Compare product position, prop scale and background contrast so the narrative keeps merchandise legible.",
      "images": [
        {
          "src": "/works/legacy/hermes/40379d8484144b6a435498fcf8b9d857.webp",
          "caption": "Summer window with a fishing rod, folding chair, fish props and a speech bubble"
        },
        {
          "src": "/works/legacy/hermes/51a7ab3976cb48ff18f4591b5056409e.webp",
          "caption": "Summer window with a mannequin, drink-shaped prop, orange slice and COOL speech bubble"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page": 6,
      "kind": "evidence",
      "case": "hermes",
      "pageId": "autumn",
      "title": "Autumn: familiar frames, unfamiliar scale",
      "body": "Doors, windows and walls establish spatial references. Oversized animals disrupt those references while framing and suspension separate merchandise from large props.",
      "images": [
        {
          "src": "/works/legacy/hermes/043e019544984416521bf2009313a5fb.webp",
          "caption": "Autumn window with an oversized pink fish passing through a doorway beside a mannequin"
        },
        {
          "src": "/works/legacy/hermes/34aa997644c1849af5a716bd5cdcf55b.webp",
          "caption": "Autumn window with a yellow snail, an open door and a suspended pink bag"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page": 7,
      "kind": "evidence",
      "case": "hermes",
      "pageId": "winter",
      "title": "Winter: different rhythms for different windows",
      "body": "Wide windows connect products across snow planes. Tall windows build a vertical hierarchy around the horse. Each format requires a new composition.",
      "images": [
        {
          "src": "/works/legacy/hermes/f1455674fa1906fe49bd555bcad97e9c.webp",
          "caption": "Wide winter window with a large white horse head, snowy planes, a yellow bag and a small pink horse"
        },
        {
          "src": "/works/legacy/hermes/776d28c61be0075bb8c93bffd65035ef.webp",
          "caption": "Layered white horse contours and suspended accessories against a blue background"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page": 8,
      "kind": "evidence",
      "case": "hermes",
      "pageId": "delivery",
      "title": "From visual direction to spatial relationships",
      "body": "My contribution was 3D design and visual presentation within BENWU. The retrospective diagram compares composition and merchandise hierarchy; individual production and store-delivery responsibility is not established.",
      "images": [
        {
          "src": "/media/v7/brand/hermes-logic.webp",
          "caption": "From visual direction to spatial relationships"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page": 9,
      "kind": "project",
      "case": "arcteryx"
    },
    {
      "page": 10,
      "kind": "evidence",
      "case": "arcteryx",
      "pageId": "layers",
      "title": "Terrain, body and equipment",
      "body": "A rock face anchors the background, layered contours form the middle ground and a mannequin establishes human scale. Their boundaries and overlap help equipment remain readable.",
      "images": [
        {
          "src": "/works/boards/arcteryx/arcteryx-01.webp",
          "caption": "Arc’teryx Mountain Performance Field | user-supplied retrospective board 01 / 10"
        },
        {
          "src": "/works/legacy/arcteryx/cb880134dd55b4ea48ac6a2c188bf65b.webp",
          "caption": "Arc’teryx Alpha Center window with rock forms, layered curves and a mannequin holding poles"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page": 11,
      "kind": "evidence",
      "case": "arcteryx",
      "pageId": "coordination",
      "title": "Communicate spatial relationships",
      "body": "Compare the rock face, curves and equipment as distinct layers. Window format, lighting and product visibility guide the spatial reading.",
      "images": [
        {
          "src": "/media/v7/brand/arcteryx-logic.webp",
          "caption": "Return to display scale"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
