      "kind": "evidence",
      "case": "arcteryx",
      "pageId": "installation",
      "title": "The window in its retail context",
      "body": "Additional installation views connect the window with the interior. Rock, directional lines, mannequins and moss surfaces extend the mountain language around clothing and circulation.",
      "images": [
        {
          "src": "/works/legacy/arcteryx/installation/arcteryx-installation-window-portrait.jpg",
